Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Padding 16

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/trading-bot"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "importlens-mcp map ."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "importlens-mcp relevant RiskManager"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
